NOTICE

Modifications: this repository redistributes a modified copy of
nvidia/nemotron-3.5-asr-streaming-0.6b (revision ea30d66debe3740a08b573244286791d423d6b3e).

What was changed:

  1. Format. The NeMo checkpoint was converted to GGUF for transcribe.cpp
     (https://github.com/handy-computer/transcribe.cpp). Conversion repackages
     the weights and renames / re-lays-out tensors; no value was altered by the
     repackaging itself.

  2. Precision. Unlike a single-preset conversion, the published file stores
     different modules at different widths (TQ1_0 ~1.69 bpw, Q4_0, Q8_0, F32).
     This is a lossy numeric transformation. The per-module assignment is the
     work of this project, not of NVIDIA.

  3. Nothing else. The weights were not retrained, not fine-tuned, and no data
     was added. The tokenizer, vocabulary and architecture are unchanged.

  4. One runtime patch, shipped here as patches/r2/0001-*.patch, is required to
     load TQ1_0 tensors into linear layers and to route the 48 pointwise 1x1
     convolutions through the linear getter. It does not change any weight.

The upstream model card is the authoritative description of the model, its
training data, and its intended use:
https://huggingface.co/nvidia/nemotron-3.5-asr-streaming-0.6b

